  Warning (ring) and/or ESP (amulet or helm) work almost as well as
telepathy.  Better in some ways because you don't have to be blind to
use them.  That means mindless creatures can't sneak up on you.  Sure,
they don't track the whole level, but I'm not sure that's a game
breaker.
 
>In particular, I should enchant my dagger stack,
>but I haven't found any scrolls of enchant weapon so far.

  The important thing about a dagger stack is to throw early and often.
Hitting monsters at a distance works so well that enchanting isn't
really necessary.  A damage bonus does just as much as enchanting them.
Increase your damage bonus by #enhancing skill, increasing strength, and
wearing rings of Increase Damage.

